= <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">[+ pnf_full_name +]</span> Collapses!

Following the March on Rome, the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">[+ pnf_full_name +]</span>, known also as the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">PNF</span>, has collapsed. [+ pnf_leader +] has fled to Switzerland in exile, while his subordinates have been arrested and are being trialed. The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">Fasces of Combat</span> have collapsed, as Dino Grandi and other prominent paramilitary leaders have been arrested in the wake of their march.

<span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Fascism</span> is dead, at least in <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">It</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">a</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">ly</span>.

- @root: Thus falls the failed experiment.